{"title":"Career Roadmap · Quality Engineer","role":"Quality Engineer","summary":"A Quality Engineer in the petrochemical, plastics and polymer industry ensures that raw materials, manufacturing processes and finished polymer products meet defined quality, performance and safety specifications.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role combines polymer science, chemical engineering, materials testing, process control, statistical quality control and manufacturing."},{"type":"p","text":"Petrochemical / Plastic / Polymer Engineering is highly aligned with this career because the student already studies polymer materials, processing, petrochemicals, additives, material properties and industrial manufacturing."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Quality Engineer is a strong entry-level career for this degree. With experience, it can progress toward Senior Quality Engineer, Quality Manager, Supplier Quality, Process Quality, Quality Assurance and Plant Quality leadership."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech + industrial internships"},{"text":"Polymer science, testing, manufacturing, QC"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Graduate / Quality Engineer"},{"text":"Inspection, testing, SPC, process quality"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Quality Engineer / Quality Specialist"},{"text":"CAPA, audits, supplier quality, process improvement"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Quality Manager / Plant Quality Head"},{"text":"Quality systems, digital quality, strategic improvement"}]]}]},{"heading":"What a Polymer Quality Engineer Does","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Quality Engineer may work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incoming raw-material inspection"},{"text":"Polymer material testing"},{"text":"In-proce